OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 8 Oct to Sat 17 Oct
OL,6,FFine and dry weather, with a few
OL,7,Fshowers in the north, will quickly
OL,8,Fgive way to a more changeable period
OL,9,Fas weather systems move in from the
OL,10,FAtlantic towards the end of next week
OL,11,Fand into the following weekend. These
OL,12,Fwill bring spells of rain or showers
OL,13,Fto most areas, heavy at times
OL,14,F(especially in the northwest) with
OL,15,Fsome strong winds. However, there will
OL,16,Fstill be some drier interludes between
OL,17,Fsystems. Into the middle of the month,
OL,18,Fsimilarly changeable conditions are
OL,19,Fmost likely, with a mixture of
OL,20,FAtlantic weather systems interspersed
OL,21,Fwith some drier, brighter spells.
OL,22,FTemperatures will likely be near to or
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fslightly below normal at first,
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Fperhaps becoming warmer later.
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
PN,16303
